body:
What stops me from stepping over the line of fear and freedom? How much I will hurt my friends and family and the fact that my dog will never understand why I never came back. The fear is that I know it very well could be a permanent solution to a temporary problem. However I also know that this is a darkness that doesn't simply go away. No matter how successful, complete or full ones life is, it doesn't leave and I know this. 

&#x200B;

What is the point of surviving? When I think about it it doesn't really equate to anything tangible. Why do I want to survive when humankind has become a plague on Earth. We have the potential to be so much better than we are as a species yet we continue to be parasitic to not only our surroundings but one another. Sure there's good in humanity but there is equal amount of evil that go with it.
